Runtime dependencies (installed by the package manager, not bundled here):
- prompt_toolkit (BSD-3-Clause)
- rich (MIT)

Optional dependency (only with the extra stewart[anthropic]):
- anthropic, the Anthropic Python SDK (MIT)

Optional external tools used only when present (not bundled):
- ripgrep (rg) for the search tool
- a SearXNG instance for the web_search tool

Web UI (hub screen). The build in src/stewart/web_ui/ is generated from ui/ and bundles:
- preact, @preact/signals (MIT)
- marked (MIT)
- highlight.js (BSD-3-Clause)
- styles generated by Tailwind CSS (MIT)

